w: Old Aunt Kate she | bake a cake, She | bake it 'hind the | gar-den gate. She | sift the meal, she | gim-me the dust, She | bake the bread, she | gim-me the crust, She | eat the meat, she | gim-me the skin, And | that's the way she | took me in.
